// DUDU V52 — REVIEW SNIPPET ONLY. Do not overwrite existing live Firestore
// Rules. Merge after backing up and comparing the currently deployed rules.
// Server-authoritative economy is accessed ONLY by Cloud Functions Admin SDK.
// Client access must remain denied to prevent changing Xu, item ownership,
// daily receipts or the active production feature gate.
//
// Insert these match blocks within the existing
// service cloud.firestore { match /databases/{database}/documents { ... } }.
//
// Production clients call callable Functions with Firebase Auth + App Check.
// Admin SDK bypasses Firestore Rules and validates the UID, server catalog,
// balance and idempotency IN SERVER TRANSACTIONS.
match /economy_accounts_v52/{uid} {
  allow read, write: if false;
  match /items/{itemId} {
    allow read, write: if false;
  }
  match /receipts/{receiptId} {
    allow read, write: if false;
  }
}
match /system_config/economy_v52 {
  allow read, write: if false;
}

// IMPORTANT: Firestore Rules ALLOW statements are additive. This snippet
// cannot cancel any overlapping wildcard allow rule. Audit existing matches
// for /economy_accounts_v52/** and /system_config/economy_v52 and test denial
// as signed-in reader, guest and author in the Firestore Emulator.
// Never merge legacy profiles_v2 fields into the verified server wallet.
